# mm01z (7x7 = 49b, 11 sticky pistons of c70b/c77's mm01 + Z + O), clk-rt 2026-10-20.
# P (1,-1) has NO ideal input: the carried observer O fires into it (see the design's header).
# Q (-1,-1) is fed by O's returns (open t18 t36 t54, close t24 t48 t60) plus:
#   - a pulse at t2 on BOTH edges (a lever-watching observer through the static (-1,0) can make it;
#     the extra close pulse is harmless: q0 = 1..2 work);
#   - open t60 (window 55..64 except 57): the one Q input left.
# Z (-2,-2): three pulses per edge (open 2-14, 22-32, 44-50; close 10-20, 36-44, 50-56).
# The other pistons keep mm01's ideal inputs. WORKS: redsim 32 positions x 3 cycles, the real game
# (door ideal) 4 x 2; open 75 / close 63.
